[00:20.770]
[00:30.720]I'm swallowed whole,
{"我被彻底吞噬，"}
[00:34.030]inside this chaotic world so easily.
{"轻易陷入这混沌世界。"}
[00:40.680]Silent wind just blows across an
{"寂静的风只是拂过"}
[00:45.870]interspace between light and dark.
{"光与暗之间的缝隙。"}
[00:50.140]
[00:51.960]I was born out of this great divide,
{"我诞生于这道巨大裂痕，"}
[00:58.240]runs through the barren ground.
{"贯穿荒芜大地。"}
[01:01.650]I need to live my life enough
{"我必须充分活过此生"}
[01:04.410]before all the leaves fall to pieces
{"在落叶尽数凋零之前"}
[01:08.720]till I am burned out.
{"直至燃尽自我。"}
[01:11.660]Oh, my body knows...
{"哦，我的身体知道……"}
[01:15.640]Just like my blood,
{"正如我的血液，"}
[01:18.070]our fight still keeps flowing
{"我们的战斗仍在奔涌"}
[01:21.430]I must struggle to survive
{"我必须挣扎求生"}
[01:23.700]So the beautiful and perfect world
{"只为让美丽完美的世界"}
[01:28.980]comes back to life.
{"重获新生。"}
[01:32.610]
[01:54.380]
[02:00.880]They come out,
{"它们涌现，"}
[02:03.180]pouring with protean threats
{"携变幻莫测的威胁"}
[02:07.620]through billowing fog.
{"穿过翻腾雾霭。"}
[02:10.420]Decayed world just makes me see
{"腐朽的世界只让我看清"}
[02:15.380]the borderline between light and dark.
{"光与暗的分界线。"}
[02:19.890]
[02:21.660]I was born out of this great divide,
{"我诞生于这道巨大裂痕，"}
[02:28.180]runs through the barren ground.
{"贯穿荒芜大地。"}
[02:31.580]I need to live my life enough
{"我必须充分活过此生"}
[02:34.400]before all the leaves fall to pieces
{"在落叶尽数凋零之前"}
[02:38.620]till I am burned out.
{"直至燃尽自我。"}
[02:41.630]Oh, my body knows...
{"哦，我的身体知道……"}
[02:45.610]Just like my blood,
{"就像我的血液，"}
[02:48.080]our fight still keeps flowing
{"我们的战斗仍在继续"}
[02:51.550]I must struggle to survive
{"我必须为生存而奋斗"}
[02:53.760]So the beautiful and perfect world
{"只为那美丽而完美的世界"}
[02:59.220]comes back to life.
{"重获新生"}
